# codex_rescue raw run logs — the request/response .md files ARE tracked (they're the
# record), but the raw event stream is not: it holds full command output, MCP tool
# arguments/results and agent messages (one run measured 409 KB across 105 lines), so it
# is both a leak risk and repo bloat.
docs/codex_rescue/.log/

